<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Merchant Pride - 70,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Cigading 1/10 August $7.50 fio scale load/7,000 shinc Glencore.</p>
<p>TBN - 70,000/10 tonnes coal Prodeco/Constanza August $10.00 fio 15,000 shinc/25,000 shex Glencore.</p>
<p>ORE - Pan Ocean TBN - 140/200,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Pohang 5/19 Sept $9.65 fio eight days shinc Posco.</p>
</text>
